sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User / Client
  participant W as Web / REST
  participant S as Service Engine
  participant E as Entity Engine
  participant DB as RDBMS

  U->>W: Submit party/order/payment form or API call
  W->>S: Invoke service with params
  S->>S: AuthZ / validation / ECA
  S->>E: create/store/find entities
  E->>DB: JDBC SQL
  DB-->>E: Result set / update count
  E-->>S: GenericValues
  S-->>W: Service result map
  W-->>U: Screen or JSON response

  Note over S,DB: Async jobs re-enter Service Engine later via JobSandbox poller
